  },
  "metadata": {
    "job": "Flat-pack box",
    "revision": "A",
    "notes": "Edit boxW, boxD or boxH in the Variables panel and all three panels resize together. cornerR drives every corner through a binding (no dimension on the canvas). The end panel is boxD - 2 * stock, so changing the material thickness in Settings resizes it too."
  },
